   The number of ways to choose 2 out of 9 is given by the combination formula:
   \[
   \binom{9}{2} = \frac{9!}{2!(9-2)!} = \frac{9!}{2!7!} = \frac{9 \times 8}{2 \times 1} = 36
   \]

