\]
The percent chop in the creep grip is:
\[
\text{Percent Chop} = \frac{A_{vf,2} - A_{vf,1}}{A_{vf,1}} \times 100 = \frac{8.333 - 9.09}{9.09} \times 100 \approx \frac{-0.7567}{9.09} \times 100 \approx -0.0833 \times 100 \approx -8.33\%
\]
